invariant: INV-17
file: ct_wipe.c
catches: unit
reason: ct_wipe leaves the last byte of a tail, the bytes after the last
  whole word, as it was. A wipe of a length that a word does not divide
  then leaves one secret byte. bin/unit wipes each length from 0 to 96 at
  each offset from 0 to 31 between guard bytes and reads every byte back.

--- old
    for (size_t i = tail; i < n; i++) {
--- new
    for (size_t i = tail; i + 1 < n; i++) {
